      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a 2022 F-150 with a slipping issue. my scan tool is showing some really weird irregular pressure spikes in the hydraulic circuit. what are the most likely things causing pressure fluctuations like that in an automatic transmission?",
